  {
    "id": "session-3-the-shadows-of-el-goroth_summary",
    "type": "text",
    "props": {
      "content": "New heroes arrive by old boat at the harbor city of Tratta joining our known hero’s, the place filled with smoke, noise, and signs that something is wrong. Caspian, Ivy Blackthorn, Jett, and Lenny begin investigating the city and quickly uncover signs of crime, corruption, and a dangerous shipment expected to arrive in twenty nights. As they move through the darker parts of the city, they learn that this shipment may be tied to a growing threat that could bring serious danger to El’goroth. Their search also leads them to an ancient text mentioning the Rotter Ball and the Gau, names connected to old power and forgotten knowledge. With only pieces of the truth in hand, the party must continue digging through the city’s secrets before the shipment arrives and whatever darkness it carries is unleashed.",
